T*
(The data center expansion in Pune adds 240 GPU nodes. Delivery is planned) Tj T*
(for August, with a fallback vendor if the primary order slips by more than) Tj T*
(three weeks. Power and cooling upgrades are budgeted at $610,000.) Tj T*
